      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p14_b3",
      "text": "Rank affects feature density (monotonically increasing at deep layers) and CKA distance (higher\nrank \u2192lower CKA at semantic layers) but does not affect the fundamental geometric novelty\n(\u223c74\u00b0 principal angles across all ranks). This suggests that rank controls how many weakly\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.72,
        181.34,
        523.71,
        219.28
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        282,
        725,
        2094,
        877
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.8,
      "font_name": "CMR10",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 276,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p14_b4",
      "text": "aligned features the adapter activates, but not the nature of those features \u2014 all ranks produce\ngeometrically separated representations.\n",
      "bbox": [
